(7247979, 1125360, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Swans, right? They don''t eat fish, they are vegetarians... Great shot though :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oops! Weird though as we watched them and they looked like they were staring under the water looking for fish then diving under. And there were loads of tiny fish near surface. Guess they were diving for vegetables:)</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Swans, right? They don''t eat fish, they are vegetarians... Great shot though :-)   Oops! Weird though as we watched them and they looked like they were staring under the water looking for fish then diving under. And there were loads of tiny fish near surface. Guess they were diving for vegetables:)', '2014-08-06 02:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
