(7247984, 1125476, 68178, '<td valign="top">Thanks Shane! <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=37858" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">chalice</a> Maybe, but I was on the boat back from Catalina, so it was goodbye ;)</td>', 'Thanks Shane!   chalice Maybe, but I was on the boat back from Catalina, so it was goodbye ;)', '2014-08-06 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7247986, 1125360, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Swans, right? They don''t eat fish, they are vegetarians... Great shot though :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>According to this article they may eat small fish?<br/> <br/>//blogs.telegraph.co.uk/news/peterwedderburn/100028222/dont-be-fooled-by-tame-swans-theyre-wild-birds-and-should-be-treated-as-such/<br/> <br/>In the wild, swans eat aquatic vegetation, with their long necks allowing them to feed on plants growing on river beds. They also eat small creatures such as molluscs that cling to the vegetation, and small fish, frogs and worms. Swans also will graze in fields, eating grass if it is available.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Swans, right? They don''t eat fish, they are vegetarians... Great shot though :-)   According to this article they may eat small fish? //blogs.telegraph.co.uk/news/peterwedderburn/100028222/dont-be-fooled-by-tame-swans-theyre-wild-birds-and-should-be-treated-as-such/ In the wild, swans eat aquatic vegetation, with their long necks allowing them to feed on plants growing on river beds. They also eat small creatures such as molluscs that cling to the vegetation, and small fish, frogs and worms. Swans also will graze in fields, eating grass if it is available.', '2014-08-06 03:11:14.000000', NULL, 0),
